{"id":"n56053-2-7","stage":4,"title":"모형 · 模板","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56053-2-7-1","ko":"붕어빵이 한결같네요.","zh":"这些鲫鱼饼都一个样呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"붕어빵이","meaning":"鲫鱼饼","explanation":"붕어빵：鲫鱼饼；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"붕어빵","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:붕어빵:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"붕어빵","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붕어빵이","audio":"/audio/66c4a2d4a64126e4342f.mp3"}},{"text":"한결같네요.","meaning":"如出一辙，同样","explanation":"한결같다：如出一辙，同样；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"한결같다","audio":"/audio/ac3dc751ea3b6b66b067.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84091","senseId":"2","lemma":"한결같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한결같네요","audio":"/audio/b0c0452f6fb6a457854a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"32f96d06af63c696","term":"붕어빵","zh":"鲫鱼饼","audio":"/audio/32f96d06af63c69673d6.mp3","definition":"外形像鲫鱼、通常包有红豆馅的烤制点心。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ac3dc751ea3b6b66","term":"한결같다","zh":"如出一辙，同样","audio":"/audio/ac3dc751ea3b6b66b067.mp3","entryId":"84091","definition":"多个都一模一样，犹如一个整体。","pronunciation":["한결갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/51d50dd0bf237df730c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56053-2-7-2","ko":"이 모형으로 찍어서 만들었으니 모양이 같죠.","zh":"用同一个模具做的，形状当然一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"모형으로","meaning":"模板，模具","explanation":"모형：模板，模具；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"모형","audio":"/audio/00e9b33fa6e7c3c4c2b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56053","senseId":"2","lemma":"모형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모형으로","audio":"/audio/69259b8824a9965e9651.mp3"}},